  "title": "I completed my 2FA Setup. Now, I cannot login to Passport York.",
  "original_html": "<div class=\"entry-content\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p>If you are unable to log in to Passport York after completing the 2FA setup, try clearing your web browser's cache and cookies.</p>\n<p>Select your web browser type for instructions on how to clear the cache and cookies:</p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li><a href=\"https://support.google.com/accounts/answer/32050?co=GENIE.Platform%3DDesktop&amp;hl=en\">Google Chrome</a></li><li><a href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/view-and-delete-browser-history-in-microsoft-edge-00cf7943-a9e1-975a-a33d-ac10ce454ca4\">Microsoft Edge</a></li><li><a href=\"https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/how-clear-firefox-cache\">Mozilla Firefox</a></li><li><a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-ca/guide/safari/sfri47acf5d6/mac\">Safari</a></li></ul>\n<p>If you cannot clear your web browser's cache and cookies, utilize <a href=\"https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95464?co=GENIE.Platform%3DDesktop&amp;hl=en\">Incognito Mode in Chrome</a> or <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-ca/guide/safari/ibrw1069/mac\">Private Mode in Safari</a>and <a href=\"https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/private-browsing-use-firefox-without-history\">Private Browsing in Firefox</a>.</p>\n<p>Back to <a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/duo-two-factor-authentication/#tab-stronggeneralissuesandtroubleshootingstrong\">General Issues and Troubleshooting page</a></p>\n<div class=\"entry-links\"></div>\n</div>",
  "html": "\n<p>If you are unable to log in to Passport York after completing the 2FA setup, try clearing your web browser's cache and cookies.</p>\n<p>Select your web browser type for instructions on how to clear the cache and cookies:</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://support.google.com/accounts/answer/32050?co=GENIE.Platform%3DDesktop&amp;hl=en\">Google Chrome</a></li><li><a href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/view-and-delete-browser-history-in-microsoft-edge-00cf7943-a9e1-975a-a33d-ac10ce454ca4\">Microsoft Edge</a></li><li><a href=\"https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/how-clear-firefox-cache\">Mozilla Firefox</a></li><li><a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-ca/guide/safari/sfri47acf5d6/mac\">Safari</a></li></ul>\n<p>If you cannot clear your web browser's cache and cookies, utilize <a href=\"https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95464?co=GENIE.Platform%3DDesktop&amp;hl=en\">Incognito Mode in Chrome</a> or <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-ca/guide/safari/ibrw1069/mac\">Private Mode in Safari</a>and <a href=\"https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/private-browsing-use-firefox-without-history\">Private Browsing in Firefox</a>.</p>\n<p>Back to <a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/duo-two-factor-authentication/#tab-stronggeneralissuesandtroubleshootingstrong\">General Issues and Troubleshooting page</a></p>\n",
  "text": "If you are unable to log in to Passport York after completing the 2FA setup, try clearing your web browser's cache and cookies. Select your web browser type for instructions on how to clear the cache and cookies: Google Chrome Microsoft Edge Mozilla Firefox Safari If you cannot clear your web browser's cache and cookies, utilize Incognito Mode in Chrome or Private Mode in Safari and Private Browsing in Firefox . Back to General Issues and Troubleshooting page",
